%% Sequence: staff draft a brief, review every statement and publish (server/routes/staff.ts).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor St as Staff reviewer
  participant S as Server
  participant A as Agents
  participant G as Gemini API
  participant C as Citation checker
  participant F as Briefs (files)
  participant Log as Log (SQLite)
  actor R as Resident

  St->>S: POST /api/staff/briefs {decisionId} or a PDF upload<br/>Authorization: Bearer passcode
  S->>S: passcode (timing-safe), daily cap, a free run slot
  S->>Log: brief.started {sources, runId}
  S->>A: draft the brief
  A->>G: plan sections (summary, impacts, have your say, lenses)
  loop each section
    A->>G: work on the section
    G-->>A: record_statement("Fares rise 5%", quote on p. 12)
    A->>C: check the quote on page 12
    C-->>A: rejected: "That quote is on page 14, not page 12. Cite page 14."
    A->>Log: statement.rejected {reasons}
    A->>G: the reasons
    G-->>A: record_statement(same text, quote on p. 14)
    A->>C: check the quote on page 14
    C-->>A: verified
    A->>Log: statement.recorded
    A-->>St: SSE progress (steps, statements)
  end
  A->>A: reading grade, lens figures, plain-language pass
  A->>F: draft brief (review status: draft)
  A->>Log: brief.generated {briefHash, statements, verified, cost}
  A-->>St: SSE brief, done

  loop every statement
    St->>S: POST /api/staff/review {statementId, action, text?, note?}
    alt edit
      S->>C: re-check the citations against the new words
      C-->>S: verified true or false (shown as is)
    end
    S->>F: review {action, by, at, note, originalText}, status: in-review
    S->>Log: statement.reviewed {action, from, to, verified, briefHash}
  end
  St->>S: POST /api/staff/publish {decisionId, reviewer}
  alt any statement unreviewed
    S-->>St: 409 "n of m statements haven't been reviewed yet"
  else all reviewed
    S->>F: status: published {by, at}, grade of what residents read
    S->>Log: brief.published {briefHash, approved, edited, rejected}
  end
  R->>S: GET /api/decisions/:id
  S-->>R: the published brief without rejected statements
  Note over St,R: Residents see "Approved by (name), (date)" and "Edited by staff" next to edited statements. Staff can also replay the agents' last real run ({replay: true}): no model, no spend.
